Package: xray-gateway
Version: @VER@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Boris Kaganovich <bkaganovich@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-pydantic,
 iproute2, iptables, curl, ca-certificates, procps
Recommends: xray-gateway-core, sing-box, dnsmasq-base
Suggests: adguardvpn-cli, fptn-client
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: Transparent split-routing VPN gateway with a web interface
 A gateway that routes traffic by destination: domestic traffic goes out
 directly, foreign traffic through a tunnel. It combines xray-core in TPROXY
 mode, sing-box, dnsmasq and a DNS-over-HTTPS proxy, and is managed through a
 web interface on port 80.
 .
 The package ships the application, its helper scripts and systemd units.
 The xray-core binary lives in xray-gateway-core; the geoip/geosite rule sets
 are downloaded after installation and refreshed by a weekly timer.
